            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "HarpersFolly"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great for 'ladies luncheons'. Chill in ring mold. Unmold onto frilly lettuce lined platter, filling center with ice cold, crisp shrimp and lemon wedges. Nice served with mini lemon poppyseed muffins. So simple and elegant.\nUse your imagination for add-ins (minced jalepanos, or cucumber is nice)."
          },
          {
