              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "SALLY22"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Perfect SOuthern Recipe....I mean, I don't really boil the V8 juice but it works. If you use individual molds put a small amount of the celery and onions in the individual mold before the juice mixture. I also add a little salt and pepper and my mom likes it with olives sliced but I don't like olives so I leave them out. Great with a dallop of homemade mayonnaise.",
